e.','The stored alt text. Describes what the image shows.'=>'The stored alt text. Describes what the image shows.','The full size height in pixels, 0 when the file carries no dimensions.'=>'The full size height in pixels, 0 when the file carries no dimensions.','The full size width in pixels, 0 when the file carries no dimensions.'=>'The full size width in pixels, 0 when the file carries no dimensions.','The full size image URL.'=>'The full size image URL.','The attachment ID. Pass it with the URL as the media control value in premium-addons/insert-widget or premium-addons/update-element-settings.'=>'The attachment ID. Pass it with the URL as the media control value in premium-addons/insert-widget or premium-addons/update-element-settings.','The matching images.'=>'The matching images.','The matching media library images, newest first.'=>'The matching media library images, newest first.','The page of results to return. Defaults to 1.'=>'The page of results to return. Defaults to 1.','How many images to return per page. Defaults to 20.'=>'How many images to return per page. Defaults to 20.','Restrict by MIME type. "image" matches every image/* type; pass a specific type such as image/svg+xml to narrow it.'=>'Restrict by MIME type. "image" matches every image/* type; pass a specific type such as image/svg+xml to narrow it.','Fetch these attachment IDs exactly, e.g. to re-resolve a previously chosen image. Overrides search, paging and the MIME filter.'=>'Fetch these attachment IDs exactly, e.g. to re-resolve a previously chosen image. Overrides search, paging and the MIME filter.','Keyword matched against the attachment title, description and filename. Alt text is not searchable. Omit to list all.'=>'Keyword matched against the attachment title, description and filename. Alt text is not searchable. Omit to list all.','Lists the images in the media library so an existing one can be reused.'=>'Lists the images in the media library so an existing one can be reused.','Get 