this site. A Premium Addons widget disabled in the dashboard is not registered.','An element or widget type name is required.'=>'An element or widget type name is required.','A JSON Schema object. Its properties map each control/prop key to its type, and — where relevant — enum, default and depends_on (the control\'s visibility prerequisite). depends_on is one of two shapes: a flat { key: value, "key!": value } map (implicit AND; "!" suffix means not-equal, an array value means in/not-in), or a nested { relation, terms } tree with explicit per-term operators (===, !==, in, <, contains). Filtered to the type\'s own settings: internal (_-prefixed) controls, editor-hidden controls, Elementor-injected common sections (motion effects, transform, background, responsive, custom CSS) and the Premium Addons global-addon sections (Floating Effects, Tooltips, Display Conditions, …) are all removed.'=>'A JSON Schema object. Its properties map each control/prop key to its type, and — where relevant — enum, default and depends_on (the control\'s visibility prerequisite). depends_on is one of two shapes: a flat { key: value, "key!": value } map (implicit AND; "!" suffix means not-equal, an array value means in/not-in), or a nested { relation, terms } tree with explicit per-term operators (===, !==, in, <, contains). Filtered to the type\'s own settings: internal (_-prefixed) controls, editor-hidden controls, Elementor-injected common sections (motion effects, transform, background, responsive, custom CSS) and the Premium Addons global-addon sections (Floating Effects, Tooltips, Display Conditions, …) are all removed.','The tab the classic schema was filtered to (all for atomic types).'=>'The tab the classic schema was filtered to (all for atomic types).','True when the type is an Elementor v4 atomic type — its schema keys are content props, and values are stored as { $$type, value } envelopes; visual props live on the styles map, not here.'=>'True when the type is an Elementor v4 