o.'=>'The ID of the Elementor page, post or template to insert the widget into.','Atomic (v4) elements are not available on this site — the e-flexbox element is not registered. Use premium-addons/add-container instead.'=>'Atomic (v4) elements are not available on this site — the e-flexbox element is not registered. Use premium-addons/add-container instead.','The ID of the document the flexbox was added to.'=>'The ID of the document the flexbox was added to.','The id of the new flexbox element.'=>'The id of the new flexbox element.','The created flexbox element.'=>'The created flexbox element.','border-radius { size, unit? (default px) }, applied to all corners.'=>'border-radius { size, unit? (default px) }, applied to all corners.','min-height { size, unit? (default px) }.'=>'min-height { size, unit? (default px) }.','height { size, unit? (default px) }.'=>'height { size, unit? (default px) }.','width { size, unit? (default px) }.'=>'width { size, unit? (default px) }.','Unit for gap (px, em, rem, %, …). Defaults to px.'=>'Unit for gap (px, em, rem, %, …). Defaults to px.','Gap between the flexbox children.'=>'Gap between the flexbox children.','flex-wrap value.'=>'flex-wrap value.','flex-direction of the flexbox. Elementor default is row.'=>'flex-direction of the flexbox. Elementor default is row.','The HTML tag the flexbox renders as. Defaults to div.'=>'The HTML tag the flexbox renders as. Defaults to div.','The id of an existing container element to nest the new flexbox inside. Omit to insert at the document root.'=>'The id of an existing container element to nest the new flexbox inside. Omit to insert at the document root.','The ID of the Elementor page, post or template to add the flexbox to.'=>'The ID of the Elementor page, post or template to add the flexbox to.','Adds an Elementor v4 flexbox container to a page.'=>'Adds an Elementor v4 flexbox container to a page.','Add Flexbox (Elementor v4 atomic)'=>'Add Flexbox (Elementor v4 atomic)','No element with id 